# Docker build-context excludes for repository-root-context builds (e.g.
# `docker build -f services/dispatch/Dockerfile .`). Universally safe
# excludes only -- caches, VCS metadata, and local virtual environments that
# no Dockerfile's COPY instructions ever need, regardless of which
# Dockerfile is being built from this context.
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/.test-venvs
**/node_modules
